                "text": "A big two thumbs down on the Trump/Republican \u201cbudget\u201d which would plunge our national debt trillions deeper into the hole and gut key programs like Medicaid on which 178,000 (26%) of my own constituents depend further basic health care, all just to cut taxes for the most well off among us. Straight out wrong fiscally, policy-wise and values-based.",
