                "text": "Millions of Medicaid patients have received quality health care at Planned Parenthood for decades and the law protects their right to do so. I joined almost 200 of my House colleagues in calling on the U.S. Supreme Court to uphold the law and protect this basic right of access to health care against these illegal attempts to restrict it. Your free choice of health care providers. https://t.co/5JgwojIgQo",
