                "text": "I\u2019m back on Capitol Hill to work with like-minded colleagues on ending this shutdown, averting this healthcare crisis and much more. But the Speaker refuses for a sixth straight week to call the House back into session to do our work. That\u2019s no way to solve real problems, and increasing millions across our country are suffering for this abdication of responsibility.",
